#: templates/store/help.html:11
msgid "Answers to the questions customers ask most often."
msgstr "Majibu ya maswali yanayoulizwa mara nyingi na wateja."

#: templates/store/help.html:20
msgid "How do I place an order?"
msgstr "Ninawezaje kuagiza?"

#: templates/store/help.html:24
msgid ""
"Choose a product, add it to your cart, confirm your delivery details, then "
"complete the M-Pesa prompt on your phone."
msgstr ""
"Chagua bidhaa, iongeze kwenye kikapu, thibitisha maelezo ya uwasilishaji, "
"kisha ukamilishe ombi la M-Pesa kwenye simu yako."

#: templates/store/help.html:30
msgid "How are delivery fees calculated?"
msgstr "Ada ya uwasilishaji huhesabiwaje?"

#: templates/store/help.html:34
msgid ""
"Choose your county during checkout to see the delivery fee. It is charged "
"once for the full order."
msgstr ""
"Chagua kaunti yako wakati wa kulipa ili kuona ada ya uwasilishaji. Ada "
"hutozwa mara moja kwa agizo lote."

#: templates/store/help.html:40
msgid "How do M-Pesa payments work?"
msgstr "Malipo ya M-Pesa hufanyaje kazi?"

#: templates/store/help.html:44
msgid ""
"After you place your order, we send an M-Pesa prompt to the phone number you "
"provided. Enter your PIN to complete payment."
msgstr ""
"Baada ya kuagiza, tutatuma ombi la M-Pesa kwa nambari ya simu uliyotoa. Weka "
"PIN yako ili kukamilisha malipo."

#: templates/store/help.html:50
msgid "Can I change quantities in my cart?"
msgstr "Je, ninaweza kubadilisha idadi ya bidhaa kwenye kikapu changu?"

#: templates/store/help.html:54
msgid ""
"Yes. Change the quantity in your cart and it will save automatically before "
"checkout."
msgstr ""
"Ndiyo. Badilisha idadi ya bidhaa kwenye kikapu chako, na itahifadhiwa "
"kiotomatiki kabla ya kulipa."

